[{"answer":"Hi Jeannie. How's it going?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh. Hello Dan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Pretty well, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you managed to get the money for the course yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's all sorted out now, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/5.mp3"},{"answer":"It took long enough, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It was practically a year ago that I applied to my local council for a grant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and it took them six months to turn me down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/8.mp3"},{"answer":"That's really slow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And I thought I was eligible for government funding,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/10.mp3"},{"answer":"but it seems I was mistaken.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/11.mp3"},{"answer":"So then I asked the boss of the company I used to work for if they would sponsor me,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and much to my surprise, he said they'd make a contribution.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/13.mp3"},{"answer":"But what about college grants and scholarships?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/14.mp3"},{"answer":"There must be some you could apply for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there are,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but they're all so small that I decided to leave them until I was desperate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And in fact, I didn't need to apply.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/18.mp3"},{"answer":"My parents had been saying that as I already had a job, I ought to support myself through college.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/19.mp3"},{"answer":"But in the end, they took pity on me, so now I've just about got enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/21.mp3"},{"answer":"So now I can put a bit of effort into meeting people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Haven't had time so far.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Any suggestions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/24.mp3"},{"answer":"What about joining some college clubs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right. You joined several, didn't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm in the drama club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It's our first performance next week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/28.mp3"},{"answer":"so we're rehearsing frantically, and I've got behind with my work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/29.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's worth it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm hoping to be in the spring production, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never liked acting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you doing anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I enjoyed singing when I was at school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so I joined a group when I came to college.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think the conductor stretches us enough, though","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/36.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'll give up after the next concert.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/37.mp3"},{"answer":"And I also joined the debating society.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It's fun, but with all the rehearsing I'm doing, something has to go,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm afraid that's the one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you do any sports?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm in one of the hockey teams.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not very good, but I'd really miss it if I stopped.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I decided to try tennis when I came to college,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm finding it pretty tough going.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm simply not fit enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Nor me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'll give that a miss!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm hoping it'll help me to build up my stamina,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/49.mp3"},{"answer":"but it'll probably be a long haul.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Good luck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/52.mp3"},{"answer":"How are you finding the course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I wish we had more seminars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/54.mp3"},{"answer":"What?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd have thought we had more than enough already.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/56.mp3"},{"answer":"All those people saying clever things that I could never think of -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/57.mp3"},{"answer":"it's quite interesting, but I wonder if I'm clever enough to be doing this course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I find it helpful to listen to the other people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the way we're exploring the subject,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and working towards getting insight into it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/61.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you get on with your tutor?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think I'm on the same wavelength as mine,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/63.mp3"},{"answer":"so I feel I'm not getting anything out of the tutorials.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/64.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be more productive to read a book instead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, mine's very demanding.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/66.mp3"},{"answer":"She gives me lots of feedback and advice,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/67.mp3"},{"answer":"so I've got much better at writing essays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And she's helping me plan my revision for the end-of-year exams.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you tell me, I always struggle with revision.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the first thing is to find out exactly what's required in the exams.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Would it help to get hold of some past papers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/73.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll help to make it clear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I'll do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Then what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you can sort out your revision priorities,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/77.mp3"},{"answer":"based on what's most likely to come up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I put these on a card, and read them through regularly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/79.mp3"},{"answer":"But that isn't enough in itself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/80.mp3"},{"answer":"You also need a timetable, to see how you can fit everything in, in the time available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Then keep it in front of you while you're studying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/82.mp3"},{"answer":"I've done that before, but it hasn't helped me!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe you need to do something different every day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/84.mp3"},{"answer":"so if you break down your revision into small tasks, and allocate them to specific days,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/85.mp3"},{"answer":"there's more incentive to tackle them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/86.mp3"},{"answer":"With big topics you're more likely to put off starting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/88.mp3"},{"answer":"And as I revise each topic","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/89.mp3"},{"answer":"I write a single paragraph about it -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/90.mp3"},{"answer":"then later I can read it through quickly, and it helps fix things in my mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/91.mp3"},{"answer":"That's brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/92.mp3"},{"answer":"I also write answers to questions for the exam practice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/93.mp3"},{"answer":"It's hard to make myself do it, though!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/94.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'll try.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks a lot, Jeannie. That's a great help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/96.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/97.mp3"},{"answer":"See you around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/98.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-4-part-3-2023-07-27-13-02-52/99.mp3"}]
